blocks.en:
Our contributions are: (1) HERD, a hybrid continual learning system that evolves a harness of skills and high-residual memory and recursively internalizes it into the weights (§ 2 );
(2) drift-constrained distillation with dual anchors, where the previous checkpoint bounds per-stage drift and the base model bounds cumulative drift (§ 2.4 );
(3) an evaluation on TRACE+17, a 25-stage stream of eight TRACE tasks ( Wang et al., 2023b ) and 17 Super-NaturalInstructions tasks ( Wang et al., 2022 ) , against parametric, non-parametric, and hybrid baselines (§ 3 ).

blocks.zh:
我们的贡献是:(1) HERD,一种混合持续学习系统,将技能和高余生记忆的利用方式演化并递归内化为权重(§2);
(2) 有双重锚地的受漂流限制蒸馏,即以前的检查站限制每相漂流,而基准模型限制累积漂流(第2.4节);
(3)对TRACE+17,由8个TRACE任务(Wang等,2023b)和17个超级自然指令任务(Wang等,2022)组成的25个阶段流,对照参数,非参数,和混合基线(§3)进行评审.

blocks.en:
The 17 additional tasks use the instruction-based formulations from Super-NaturalInstructions ( Wang et al., 2022 ) ; the task identifiers map to the following original resources:
024, Cosmos QA ( Huang et al., 2019 ) ;
074, SQuAD 1.1 ( Rajpurkar et al., 2016 ) ;
195, Sentiment140 ( Go et al., 2009 ) ;
511, Reddit TIFU ( Kim et al., 2019 ) ;
1219, the multilingual TED corpus, English-to-Spanish translation ( Qi et al., 2018 ) ;
574, AirDialogue ( Wei et al., 2018 ) ;
192, HotpotQA ( Yang et al., 2018 ) ;
177, ParaNMT ( Wieting and Gimpel, 2018 ) ;
064, the synthetic list-processing task contributed by Pulkit Verma to Super-NaturalInstructions; 3 3 3 https://github.com/allenai/natural-instructions/blob/master/tasks/task064_all_elements_except_first_i.json 346, HybridQA ( Chen et al., 2020 ) ;
108, the Contextual Abuse Dataset ( Vidgen et al., 2021 ) ;
111, ASSET ( Alva-Manchego et al., 2020 ) ;
1415, Emily McMilin’s YouTube Caption Corrections; 4 4 4 https://github.com/2dot71mily/youtube_captions_corrections 1447, ADE Corpus V2 ( Gurulingappa et al., 2012 ) ;
828, COPA ( Roemmele et al., 2011 ) ;
1728, WebNLG ( Gardent et al., 2017 ) ;
and 217, ROCStories ( Mostafazadeh et al., 2016 ) .
The Super-NaturalInstructions task files identify both the original sources and the contributors of the instruction-based formulations. 5 5 5 https://github.com/allenai/natural-instructions/tree/master/tasks

